grpc does not recognise DragonFly, so port_platform.h stops with "Could not
auto-detect platform" (run 35777846756).  This is grpc#43396, which is open
upstream and applies to 1.76.0 as it stands.  CI only.

diff --git a/include/grpc/event_engine/port.h b/include/grpc/event_engine/port.h
index 3055a667e0dcf..c5820daacd2df 100644
